    <string name="privacy_title">Your cube, your privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Rubik Buddy processes camera frames on your device to read cube colors. Frames are discarded after analysis; photos and videos are never saved or uploaded.

The app has no accounts, ads, analytics, crash-reporting SDKs, or tracking. Your cube state stays in memory while the app is open. Scanning and solving work offline.

Camera access is requested only when you start scanning. You can change permission in your device Settings.

Opening the policy or support link launches your browser; the destination website has its own privacy practices. Contact Freevia at info@freevia.org for privacy or support questions.

Rubik Buddy is an independent app, not affiliated with or endorsed by the owner of the Rubik’s Cube trademark.

Policy reviewed: 19 October 2026.</string>
